## API #1: `GET /api/v1/admin/subscription/subscribers`

### Currently Available (No Change Needed):
| Field | Example | ✅ |
|-------|---------|---|
| `user._id, nickname, email, photo` | Object | ✅ |
| `platform` | `"android"` | ✅ |
| `productId` | `"com.keenasmustard.premium.1month"` | ✅ |
| `planType` | `"1_MONTH"` | ✅ |
| `status` | `"ACTIVE"` | ✅ |
| `autoRenew` | `true` | ✅ |
| `startedAt` | ISO date | ✅ |
| `expiresAt` | ISO date | ✅ |
| `isExpired` | `false` | ✅ |
| `createdAt` | ISO date | ✅ |

### 🔴 NEW Field Needed:
| Field | Type | Values | Purpose |
|-------|------|--------|---------|
| `source` | String | `"STORE"` \| `"ADMIN"` \| `"GIVEAWAY"` | Shows how subscription was created |

### Example Response (per subscriber):
```json
{
    "user": {
        "_id": "...",
        "nickname": "Rajat",
        "email": "test@test.com",
        "photo": "https://..."
    },
    "_id": "...",
    "platform": "android",
    "productId": "com.keenasmustard.premium.1month",
    "planType": "1_MONTH",
    "status": "ACTIVE",
    "autoRenew": true,
    "startedAt": "2026-03-16T07:11:22.346Z",
    "expiresAt": "2026-04-15T07:11:22.346Z",
    "isExpired": false,
    "source": "STORE",
    "createdAt": "2026-03-16T07:11:23.789Z"
}
```

