## API #3: `POST /api/v1/admin/subscription/users/:userId/grant` (EXISTING — Minor Enhancement)

This already exists. Just make sure:

1. ✅ It sets `platform: "ADMIN_GRANTED"` on the created subscription
2. 🔴 It sets `source: "ADMIN"` on the created subscription
3. ✅ It accepts `reason` in request body and stores it
4. ✅ It creates a Transaction record with `eventType: "ADMIN_GRANT"`

### Request Body (no change needed):
```json
{
    "planType": "MONTHLY",
    "durationDays": 30,
    "reason": "1000th User Reward"
}
```

### Response:
```json
{
    "success": true,
    "message": "Subscription granted successfully",
    "data": {
        "subscription": { ...new subscription object... }
    }
}
```

