## API #5: `POST /api/v1/admin/subscription/users/:userId/revoke` (EXISTING — Minor Enhancement)

This already exists. Just add a validation:

### 🔴 Add Revoke Restriction:
```javascript
// Before revoking, check source
if (subscription.source === "STORE") {
    return res.status(400).json({
        success: false,
        message: "Cannot revoke store-purchased subscriptions. User must request refund through Apple/Google."
    });
}
```

Only allow revoking subscriptions where `source` is `"ADMIN"` or `"GIVEAWAY"`.

### Request Body (optional enhancement):
```json
{
    "reason": "Policy violation"
}
```

### Response (no change):
```json
{
    "success": true,
    "message": "Subscription revoked successfully"
}
```

