## API #6: `POST /api/v1/admin/subscription/users/:userId/grant-consumable` (EXISTING — Minor Enhancement)

### Current request body works. Just ensure `reason` is stored:
```json
{
    "type": "SUPER_KEEN",
    "quantity": 5,
    "reason": "Compensation for bug"
}
```

### Make sure the Transaction record includes:
```json
{
    "eventType": "ADMIN_CONSUMABLE_GRANT",
    "amount": 0,
    "reason": "Compensation for bug",
    "productId": "SUPER_KEEN"
}
```

