## Schema Change: Add `source` to Subscription Model

```javascript
// In your Subscription schema/model
source: {
    type: String,
    enum: ["STORE", "ADMIN", "GIVEAWAY"],
    default: "STORE"
}
```

### When to set each value:
| Scenario | `platform` value | `source` value |
|----------|-----------------|----------------|
| User buys via iOS App Store | `"ios"` | `"STORE"` |
| User buys via Google Play | `"android"` | `"STORE"` |
| Admin grants via dashboard | `"ADMIN_GRANTED"` | `"ADMIN"` |
| Giveaway worker grants | `"ADMIN_GRANTED"` | `"GIVEAWAY"` |

> [!TIP]
> For existing records in DB that don't have `source`, set default = `"STORE"` in schema so they automatically show as Store purchases.

